----------------------------------------ENDOFMESSAGE

I assumed he objected to my using one of the workstations for a game.
Typical University Bureaucratic Idiocy dictates that if any machine
is being used for game playing, even if no one else is logged on,
resources are being wasted.  (and _no_one_ else was logged onto the
